LEMON is an LALR(1) parser generator for C or C++.
http://www.hwacl.com/sw/lemon/lemon.html

3.5.0 Initial version
    The source is taken from sqlite-3.5.0 (http://www.sqlite.org)

    FILES
    lemon.c - modified version of sqlite's lemon.c
    lempar.c - modified version of sqlite's lempar.c
    history/lemon-3.5.0.patch - diff against original sqlite-3.5.0 lemon.c
    history/lempar-3.5.0.patch - diff against original sqlite-3.5.0 lempar.c
    
    BUILD
    just make;
    $ make
    
    MODIFICATIONS
    1. -t option added to specify default parser template file
